_/tests/unit/test_summarize.py: Test helper class `FakeClientError` is duplicated across test files. Found in test_summarize.py (lines 15-21) and test_translate.py (lines 15-23) with nearly identical implementations:

```python
class FakeClientError(Exception):
    def __init__(self, code: str, status: int = 400) -> None:
        super().__init__(code)
        self.response = {
            "Error": {"Code": code},
            "ResponseMetadata": {"HTTPStatusCode": status},
        }
```

This 8-line non-trivial helper should be shared rather than copy-pasted.
